<translation id="1436390408194692385"><ph name="TICKET_TIME_LEFT" />동안 유효</translation>
<translation id="1438630805136563416"><ph name="REMOVED_ACTION" /> 작업이 삭제되었습니다</translation>
<translation id="1439671507542716852">장기적 지원</translation>
